Rationale: Phase-0 in-tree contracts package per docs/REPO_SPLIT_PLAN.md, with the verification-review corrections applied. Implementation-free (types + constants only): the reviewed plan's B4 defect was shipping freshTypedDocId/uuidUtils/NestJS runtime into CONTRACTS.
Privacy & security: zero data egress. No network calls, no credentials, no fs/crypto/DOM/Yjs imports. The package holds only field shapes and literal constants; EMPTY_SHA256 and SHA256_HEX_REGEX are public wire constants. Discarded alternative: a runtime predicate package (rejected — freshTypedDocId needs a UUID source and validators are behavior).
